Z||000000||NoCAChpt,Sacramento||09-03-2001||10:44 PM||||The Sacramento area Fiero club will be meeting on Sept. 22 in Carmichael, CA.  Round Table Pizza, 4949 Marconi, at Walnut 11:30 A.M. <P>Coming attractions include the all-Pontiac show in October, Thunderhill Park driving school, drives to the "Delta", Gray Lodge Wildlife Area, and the Blackhawk car museum in Danville.  <P>Club activities recently completed include the Sears Point Car corral at the Historic races this spring, and winning cars at the West Coast Fiero Fest in San Leandro.<P>Check out our web site at <BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/norcalfiero" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/norcalfiero</A> <p>[This message has been edited by NoCAChpt,Sacramento (edited 09-03-2001).]||||reg||1
